The '''Bristlewhisker''' are a group of kobolds found at the [[Bristlewhisker Cavern]] in [[Northwind]].

Recently, the Bristlewhisker stole the [[Ambershire Church]]'s remaining [[Amber Candle]]s.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|29|To Light the Afterlife}}</ref> Other Bristlewhisker kobolds were enslaved by the [[Dark Iron clan]] and put to work in [[Sherwood Quarry]] by [[Overseer Bragordi]].<ref>[[Maltorius' Missive]]</ref>

